WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.040
The theme of the last round
of the three-round competition

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.680
with the mysterious masked chef is stewing.

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.010
Pot dish.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.650
I have to let Chef Zhou Yu and Meili

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.120
drink the antidotes as soon as possible.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:46.000
The time is running out.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:47.290
After all the blood of the blood timer drops,

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:48.310
everyone will die.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:49.830
Judge the dishes now.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:51.440
Take your time, kid.

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.240
I've got a

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:54.360
suitable judge for

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:55.460
this round.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.070
Silang!

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:07.840
Heroism! Grand Finale of Revenge!

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:13.620
Come on. Taste them now.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.540
Use your tongue to decide which is more delicious.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:20.350
If you pick

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.560
the dish made by Mao,

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.620
everyone here will be saved.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:28.560
But if you pick the dish made by me,

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:29.800
I'll ask that boy to

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.270
drink this bottle of poison.

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.330
One is the seafood pot dish made of seafood,

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.370
and the other

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.050
is the wild vegetable pot dish
made of wild vegetables.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.320
Both dishes are so fragrant.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.540
One is made by Mao,

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:05.950
and the other

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.790
is made by the disgusting masked jerk.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.450
Which one...

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.560
Which one is made by Mao?

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.910
How can I tell which one is made by Mao?

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:22.460
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:24.940
If you don't hurry up, the time will run out.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:28.530
But I don't care if the time is running out.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.170
Silang,

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:38.810
you don't need to guess which one is made by me.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.910
You just need to pick the delicious dish
as you think.

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.050
That's the dish made by me.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:49.330
Kid, why are you still so arrogant now?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.200
You need to taste them carefully.

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.480
Then compare the different scenes

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.670
formed above your tongue.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.030
I got it, Mao.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.300
Great.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:03.040
What?

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.460
Yes, it's not difficult actually.

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.860
I just need to trust Mao.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.880
As long as I trust Mao,

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.560
I'll definitely be right.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.590
Focus on my tongue.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.160
OK. I'll try the seafood first.

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:20.090
This is the white pot, right?

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:28.790
It... It is really...

00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:37.320
It's the sea.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:44.030
The flavor of lobsters

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.470
and the sweetness of

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.760
all kinds of excellent seafood above them.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.600
They're coming like the waves.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:52.770
The refreshing and thick stock.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.650
I think they're dried foods

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:59.470
which have absorbed the essence of
the sunlight completely

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.170
and have been stored for a long time.

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:04.280
This pot

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.920
is like a huge dragon swimming in the sea.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:11.950
It's so great!

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:13.800
It's so delicious that I can't pick holes in it.

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.850
Next, I'll taste the dish of the black pot.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.400
There are so many impurities in the stock.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.670
How can it be delicious?

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:45.750
I think event a layman

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:46.990
like this kid

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.150
can recognize the difference.

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.250
Those dried foods

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.110
have absorbed my hatred for sixteen years.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.490
I've already unreservedly shown you

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.200
the most essential tastiness of them.

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.040
His pot dish is much worse than mine.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.290
I'm the winner.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.790
I want to take revenge on Zhou Yu
who took Meixiang away from me.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.840
The hatred I've accumulated since

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.130
I joined the Dark Cooking Society sixteen years ago

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.240
is going to be liquidated now.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.650
Kid, tell us your judgment.

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:24.620
I have no idea which pot dish is made by Mao.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.180
But,

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.830
I'm clear which pot dish I think is

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:31.710
really delicious.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.370
That is...

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.000
It's my white pot, right?

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:42.880
It's the black pot!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:43.560
What?

00:06:48.150 --> 00:06:49.280
How can it be the black pot?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:57.710
Great!

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.930
Mao!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.010
Silang!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:04.490
We'll be saved.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.320
Everyone will be saved, right?

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:10.770
Good job, Silang.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:12.860
Your taste is accurate.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:17.690
Wait a minute.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.430
Why?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.260
Why did you pick his pot?

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:23.300
Have you

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:25.280
exchanged signals that
I can't understand to each other?

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:26.600
Mao!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.690
We don't need to do that.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.020
Then why?

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:33.870
It's because

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.910
the levels of your dishes are different,

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.100
masked old man.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.220
What are you talking about?

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.060
The seafood pot dish made by you

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.130
is very delicious,

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:45.660
but the core of this pot

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:46.490
is the lobster, right?

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:51.190
The flavor of your lobsters has been

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:52.460
completely covered by the thick stock

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:53.690
which is made of other seafood.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:07:59.310
But,

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.920
Mao's wild vegetable pot is different.

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:04.470
Different kinds of wild vegetables
are mixed together.

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:06.530
The taste is very gentle.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.170
Therefore, with foils, the original sweetness of

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.810
the lobsters tastes even better.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:13.050
It shows a stronger and more incredible taste.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:14.810
If I have to use a metaphor,

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:20.020
I'll say it's like a huge golden dragon
flying in the mountains.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.030
It's the scene

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:23.900
my tongue felt.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:27.580
(Super)

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.610
The wild vegetable is indeed a treasury of the stock.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.940
So maybe it's true that it can bring out
the deliciousness of the lobster.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.020
But since there are so many

00:08:39.070 --> 00:08:40.060
impurities in the stock,

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:41.800
it's impossible to make a delicate dish.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.350
Not to mention that he didn't have the time

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.750
to remove all the impurities.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.310
In that case,

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:47.520
why did you still pick his pot?

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.810
This is the secret.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:00.950
This... This is...

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:02.140
This is the paper pot.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:04.400
You mean the paper pot?

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:07.970
The paper is...

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.170
Is it the paper of that time?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:12.870
Kid,

00:09:13.350 --> 00:09:15.140
the reason why you tore the pages of the cookbook

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:16.770
is not that you wanted to read them.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.040
Right.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.270
I tore them to make the paper pot.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.000
Are you kidding me?

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.190
How can something like that be a pot?

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:28.630
Then I'll show you.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:34.250
Look. That's it.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.840
In the paper pot, the stock can also be boiled.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.300
You took advantage of the fact that the wet paper

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.380
will not burn.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.610
But so what?

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.620
You'll get it soon.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:46.730
What?

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:53.020
The paper...The paper pot absorbed all the impurities.

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.070
Even the characters

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:01.990
at the bottom are very clear.

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:07.590
You removed the impurities

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:10.320
and made the perfect bouillon like that?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:11.490
No matter

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.780
how tiny the impurity is,

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.570
the paper can absorb it for us.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:17.030
I've been

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.810
changing the paper pots when I made the dish.

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:26.770
You've seen through everything
since the beginning.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.260
Is this your real competence?

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.080
He easily surpassed my cooking skills which have been

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.750
accumulated for sixteen years.

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.610
What an incredible kid!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.810
I lost, kid.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.020
We succeeded!

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:12.480
In the Three-round Lobster Competition,
we won two rounds and lost one round.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.540
Mao, you won!

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.060
Hurry up.

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:19.600
Zhou Yu! Meili!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.760
Elders!

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.020
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:36.010
You're okay now.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.500
Don't worry, sir.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:44.830
Meili. Meili. Meili.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:46.830
Hang in there, Meili!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.380
Meili! Meili!

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:53.090
Wake up, Meili!

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:54.810
Mao.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.520
Great, Meili.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.290
What happened to me?

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:14.240
Zhou Yu.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:21.990
That kid succeeded to

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:23.970
stop my revenge plan.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.380
In the past sixteen years,

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:28.970
avenging my humiliation is the only reason I lived for.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.190
But Zhou Yu,

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.340
I will never forget about

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.030
the despicable means

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.710
you used to get Meixiang.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.590
Putting an anesthesia needle
in your opponent's lobster container

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:46.360
is the dirtiest thing that a chef can do.

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:47.080
Impossible.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:48.200
You're lying!

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:50.870
Zhou Yu will never do something like that!

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.950
You're the one who poisoned Zhou Yu!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:55.640
Mao.

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:57.080
But...

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:58.080
Stop talking.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:02.270
Sixteen years ago.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.260
At that time,

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:07.030
Meixiang and I already pledged to
get married secretly.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:10.510
It's rare.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.410
I can't believe that you can also tell jokes, Zhou Yu.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.750
Stop talking nonsense here!

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.310
Is it real?

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:27.800
Meixiang's father was very strict.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.110
In order to test

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.400
whether I was good enough for Meixiang,

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.550
he arranged that cooking competition.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.400
And the person who stood out and challenged me

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:37.350
was you.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:38.260
What?

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:39.860
Meixiang

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.580
had been very worried.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.360
My opponent was so powerful.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.210
She was worried that I would lose.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.010
Meixiang was worried and sad.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.850
I didn't expect that in the end, she...

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:08.330
Liar!

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.200
Who would believe something like that?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.100
Meixiang would never...

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:15.990
If what you said is true,

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.740
why didn't you tell me at that time?

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:19.880
Why?

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:23.830
Because in your mind, Meixiang

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.000
is very perfect.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.780
All the dishes you ordered are here, right?

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:33.700
Miss Meixiang.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.980
I must marry Meixiang.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:38.620
I must marry Meixiang.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.600
If I told the truth to you,

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:43.500
your feelings for Meixiang

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.770
would fall apart in the worst way.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.420
So I decided to hide the truth

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:53.930
and attract all your hatred to me.

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:57.040
But it's wrong.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:14:59.590
I didn't expect that

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.170
you would be so sad about it.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.560
Meixiang regretted it so much even before her death.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:07.280
She hoped I can tell you her feelings

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.130
if I have a chance to meet you.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:15.120
Sorry.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.510
Sorry.

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:19.580
Sorry.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:22.380
I'm so sorry.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:31.570
I got it.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.900
Meixiang apologized to me?

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:41.860
Apology.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.120
You've always been like that.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.940
Zhou Yu, you're too silent.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.830
Every time I arrogantly chase my tail alone.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.460
No matter what the reason is,

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.970
maybe since I sold my chef's spirit

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.270
to the hatred,

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:04.760
I've been destined

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.440
to fail forever.

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.570
Why are you hurt like that?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:28.130
I've seen the Hell

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:30.510
which is called the Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.780
The Dark Cooking Society.

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.200
The Dark Cooking Society is a huge organization
that bases itself

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.700
everywhere in the mainland
and hides in the shadows.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.420
It consists of a group of dauntingly paranoid
and cruel people.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.030
Once you sell your spirit
to the Dark Cooking Society,

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.100
you're destined to

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.800
be controlled by them forever.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.440
You're so shallow.
How can you take revenge on him?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.380
People who join the Dark Cooking Society

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.390
have to endure the purgatory

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.120
and sacrifice themselves to take revenge
on the whole world.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.140
But it's all over now.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:09.920
Kid.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:11.970
Luckily, I met you.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.470
You helped me get back

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:16.600
my chef's spirit at the lost moment.

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:18.310
Thank you.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:34.600
She really looks like her mother,

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:37.860
which makes me feel sad.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.300
Li Yan, what's wrong?

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.220
Li Yan, you took the poison!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.500
You finally call me by my name, Zhou Yu.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:09.430
Why?

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.890
This is the fate of people who join

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:19.090
the Dark Cooking Society.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.670
You... You need to be careful, Zhou Yu.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.690
The Dark Cooking Society will definitely do something

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:31.670
to that kid and you.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.240
My father and Mao?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:35.810
Zhou Yu,

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.240
have you competed with this kid?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:40.500
No.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:43.080
He's very promising.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:45.500
When he cooks a dish,

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:46.990
he's not puzzled

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.460
and he has no evil thoughts.

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:51.460
He's even better than you when you were young.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.410
Only people who have competed with him can know

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:58.280
his real competence is unfathomable.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:00.760
One day,

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.360
this kid and you

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.920
will be responsible for
the whole Chinese Cooking Society.

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:07.570
The Dark Cooking Society will never let you go.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.280
Why is there a burning smell?

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:17.400
This smoke...

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.350
Go away, Zhou Yu!

00:19:29.620 --> 00:19:30.110
Li Yan!

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:30.960
You...

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:33.920
Run!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:35.490
Zhou Yu.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.000
Li Yan, don't do that!

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:38.190
Go back now!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:39.130
Meixiang...

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.320
Was Meixiang happy?

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.050
Yes.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:49.970
Really?

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:54.410
Li Yan, wait!

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:57.100
Goodbye, Zhou Yu.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.000
Li Yan.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.650
Li Yan!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.900
Li Yan!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.160
Li Yan, I swear to you here that

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:41.270
I'll make Mao the best chef in China.

00:20:42.890 --> 00:20:43.930
I also swear to you that

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.790
no matter who the Dark Cooking Society sends here,

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.130
I will never lose.

00:20:56.330 --> 00:20:59.180
I need to go back and report it to my superiors.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.120
Sixteen years ago.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:18.740
I didn't know

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:19.830
anything happened

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.490
between my father and my mother.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.830
My father also has an opponent.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.890
My opponent is cooking, I think.

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:18.646 --> 00:23:20.148
It was a beautiful spring day,

00:23:20.231 --> 00:23:22.067
and the restaurant was going to
have a fishing tournament.

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:25.028
However, an unintentional comment from Master Ruoh

00:23:25.028 --> 00:23:27.530
made it a serious and tense game.

00:23:27.614 --> 00:23:29.657
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:32.035
The Outdoor Cuisine of Friendship

00:23:32.076 --> 00:23:33.537
It will definitely be interesting!
